{
  "uid": "timetracker-negocio",
  "title": "TimeTracker — Negocio y Frontend",
  "description": "Métricas funcionales (§22) y RUM del navegador (§16). Los contadores se muestran redondeados: increase() extrapola y devolvía valores como '5,3 logins fallidos'. Las ventanas siguen al selector de tiempo.",
  "tags": [
    "timetracker",
    "negocio",
    "rum"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "tenant",
        "label": "Empresa",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(timetracker_timers_started_total, tenant_id)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "sesion",
        "label": "Sesión (pegar sessionId)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Seguimiento de tiempo",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Timers iniciados",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(timetracker_timers_started_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "iniciados"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Timers detenidos",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(timetracker_timers_stopped_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "detenidos"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Sin cerrar en el rango",
      "description": "Iniciados menos detenidos dentro de la ventana visible. Es una aproximación, no un inventario: un timer abierto ayer y cerrado hoy descuadra el saldo. Sirve para detectar la tendencia de la alerta 'timers abandonados' (§27); el número exacto de timers abiertos hay que consultarlo en la base.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 3
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "clamp_min(round(sum(increase(timetracker_timers_started_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range]))) - round(sum(increase(timetracker_timers_stopped_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range]))), 0)",
          "legendFormat": "sin cerrar"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Horas registradas",
      "description": "minutes_tracked_total convertido a horas. Es la métrica que sustenta los reportes y el cálculo de costos.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "h",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "purple"
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(timetracker_minutes_tracked_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range])) / 60",
          "legendFormat": "horas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cargas manuales",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "yellow"
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(timetracker_time_entries_created_manual_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "manuales"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Actividad de timers por empresa",
      "description": "tenant.id como dimensión (§22): distingue si algo afecta a una empresa o a todas.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 40,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum by (tenant_id) (increase(timetracker_timers_started_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "empresa {{tenant_id}}"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Minutos registrados",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "m",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum by (tenant_id) (increase(timetracker_minutes_tracked_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "empresa {{tenant_id}}"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Trabajo y usuarios",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Issues creados",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(timetracker_issues_created_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "issues"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Proyectos creados",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(timetracker_projects_created_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "proyectos"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Reportes generados",
      "description": "Desglosado por tipo de reporte.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum by (report_type) (increase(timetracker_reports_generated_total[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{report_type}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Inicios de sesión: exitosos vs fallidos",
      "description": "Un pico de fallidos sin aumento de exitosos es la señal de §27. Se cuenta sin registrar el email, para no almacenar datos personales.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "drawStyle": "bars"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "fallidos"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "exitosos"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(timetracker_users_logged_in_logins_total[$__interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "exitosos"
        },
        {
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(timetracker_login_failed_logins_total[$__interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "fallidos"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Frontend y RUM",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Web Vitals P75 — LCP, FCP, TTFB, INP",
      "description": "Medidos en el dispositivo real del usuario (§16). SLO de §28: LCP P75 por debajo de 2,5 s en escritorio. CLS va aparte porque no es una medida de tiempo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "always"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 2500
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 4000
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.75, sum by (le, vital_name) (rate(timetracker_web_vital_milliseconds_bucket{vital_name!=\"CLS\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{vital_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errores del navegador y CLS",
      "description": "CLS es un desplazamiento acumulado sin unidad, por eso no comparte panel con las métricas en milisegundos.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 23
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "drawStyle": "bars"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "CLS P75"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.drawStyle",
                "value": "line"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisPlacement",
                "value": "right"
              },
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "none"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 3
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum by (route) (increase(timetracker_frontend_errors_total[$__interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "errores JS — {{route}}"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.75, sum by (le) (rate(timetracker_web_vital_milliseconds_bucket{vital_name=\"CLS\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "CLS P75"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Errores recientes — clic en TraceID para abrir la traza",
      "description": "El derived field del datasource de Loki convierte el traceId en un enlace a Tempo: es el recorrido síntoma → causa de §32.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "exact"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"timetracker-.+\"} |= \"\\\"@l\\\":\\\"Error\\\"\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Uso de la aplicación",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 41
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Eventos de uso más frecuentes",
      "description": "Catálogo de §23. La métrica dice cuántos; para saber quién y en qué orden está el panel de recorrido de sesión.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 42
      },
      "interval": "1m",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 50,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum by (event_name) (increase(timetracker_frontend_events_total[$__interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{event_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Recorrido de una sesión — pegar el sessionId en la variable de arriba",
      "description": "Responde 'qué venía haciendo el usuario antes del error' (§23). Sin un sessionId muestra los últimos eventos de uso de todas las sesiones. El sessionId aparece en cualquier error del navegador.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 42
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Ascending",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{service_name=\"timetracker-api\"} |= \"$sesion\" |~ \"Evento de uso|Error de API visto|Error de frontend\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
